  "bio": "Brittany Brown is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black & gray styles, known for her meticulous approach and stunning designs. Residing in Lock Haven, United States, Brittany is the esteemed owner of @pinchnpoke and the creative mind behind @the_vista_project. Her professionalism is evident not only in the quality of her work but also through her roles as a resident guest artist at renowned studios such as @evolutiontattoodenver and @dancingneedlestattoo.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lock Haven, Pennsylvania, United States"
